/farmland-atlas/texas/tom-green-county"],["ARC or PLC in Tom Green County","/arc-plc/texas/tom-green-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, February to March landed at 14% of normal and July to August at 203%. Grid 13618 saw its driest year in 2011, at 44% of normal.</p>"}
